---
title: Order lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Submitted: customer pays
  state Fulfilment {
    Submitted --> Picking: warehouse accepts
    Picking --> Packed: items scanned
    Packed --> Shipped: courier collects
  }
  state Exceptions {
    Refunded
    Failed
  }
  Submitted --> Failed: payment declined
  Shipped --> Delivered: signature captured
  Delivered --> Refunded: return approved
  Delivered --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
